# 📝 Todo List Application

A simple and responsive Todo List application built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

This project allows users to create, edit, complete, filter, and delete tasks. Tasks are stored in the browser's Local Storage, so the data remains available even after refreshing the page.

## 🚀 Features

- ➕ Add new tasks
- ⌨️ Add tasks using the Enter key
- ✏️ Edit and update existing tasks
- ✅ Mark tasks as completed
- 🔄 Change completed tasks back to pending
- 🔍 Filter tasks:
     - All
     - Pending
     - Completed
- ❌ Delete individual tasks
- 🗑️ Clear all tasks
- 💾 Persistent data using Local Storage
- ⚠️ Delete confirmation
- 📱 Responsive design
- 🎨 Clean and modern UI
- 🔔 Empty-state message when no tasks are available

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (ES6)
- DOM Manipulation
- Local Storage
- Event Delegation

